OL,3,GNEWSAEsports gave me a place to belong,
OL,4,Asays student
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old student has described how
OL,7,Fan esports course provided him with a
OL,8,Flearning environment in which he
OL,9,Ffinally felt like he belonged.
OL,11,FEsports is a #2.2bn global industry
OL,12,Finvolving competitive video gaming,
OL,13,Fwith tournaments attracting millions of
OL,14,Fplayers and spectators as well as
OL,15,Foffering large monetary prizes.
OL,17,F"For years I've stressed throughout
OL,18,Fhigh school trying to think what's
OL,19,Fnext," says Denis, who is studying for
OL,20,Fa Level 3 BTec in the course at Central
OL,21,FBedfordshire College in Dunstable.
