OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite trying different courses, Denis
OL,7,Fsaid he never found something he "truly
OL,8,Fenjoyed" until he took up esports,
OL,9,Fwhich he stressed was not just about
OL,10,Fplaying video games in a bedroom.
